```text
OS = Resource Manager

Program = Static

Process = Running Program

Thread = Smallest Execution Unit

Context Switching = CPU Switch

Deadlock = Waiting Forever

Semaphore = Resource Counter

Mutex = Lock

Race Condition = Concurrent Data Problem

Critical Section = Shared Code

Paging = Fixed Memory Blocks

Virtual Memory = Disk as RAM

Thrashing = Excessive Swapping

Kernel Mode = Full Access

User Mode = Restricted Access
